"seen_share": 0.978,
"longest_unseen_arc_deg": 4.8,
"dates_agree": "line: 89% (2022) and 76% (2019) of shared points within 0.5 m after lining up",
"placement": "NOT PINNED. Google Earth places the three aerials up to 1.8 m apart. Pinning by the grass edge against the current 3D view gives 2023 (+0.15, -1.68) m but the same method on 2019 and 2022 disagrees with the line-to-line shifts by 1.5-2 m, so the grass edge can't pin it to better than about 2 m. Pin it to the rebuilt model (#2035) when that lands."
},
